        "explanation": "Doctor addresses the family's practical fear of misreading the iron syrup label and provides a safe alternative: if the dose is unclear, do not start the medicine tonight but verify with the clinic or pharmacy tomorrow.",
        "quote": "那个葡萄糖酸亚铁糖浆还是先没喂，明天带药瓶和出院小结去新生儿门诊当面核对"
      }
    ]
  },
