        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repairs the unclear discharge instructions by explicitly assigning the neonatal follow-up clinic as the responsible channel, instructing the family to bring the discharge summary and medication bottles, and specifying what questions to ask. This goes beyond generic advice and directly fulfills the HO3 requirement to repair an incomplete handoff/follow-up responsibility chain.",
